OL,3,C'We need rain to keep the food
OL,4,Cgrowing': Farmer's stark warning
OL,6,FA farmer is warning that the ongoing
OL,7,Fheat is already having an impact on
OL,8,Ffood production locally, with a
OL,9,Fshortage of potatoes likely.
OL,11,FDavid Fryer is an arable farmer in
OL,12,FCheshire who runs Groobarbs Wild Farm
OL,13,Fwith his family.
OL,15,F"I thought it can't be as dry as 2025
OL,16,Fwe got through that just about, we
OL,17,Fkept getting little bits of rain that
OL,18,Fkept the crops alive, but I never
OL,19,Fthought 2026 would be drier," he said.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G1/7
