PN,36302
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F363A1786470511
OL,3,C'We need rain to keep the food
OL,4,Cgrowing': Farmer's stark warning
OL,6,F"The potato yield is about half what
OL,7,Fit should be, I am just about ok
OL,8,Fbecause I've grown more but I think
OL,9,Facross the North West people will be
OL,10,Fshort on potatoes, we've also suffered
OL,11,Fwith cauliflower, broccoli and
OL,12,Fsweetcorn."
OL,14,FThe North West is on course for one of
OL,15,Fhottest summers with the Environment
OL,16,FAgency placing most of the region into
OL,17,F'Prolonged Dry Weather status'.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G2/7
