CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F363A1786470511
OL,3,C'We need rain to keep the food
OL,4,Cgrowing': Farmer's stark warning
OL,6,FAmber heat health alerts will be in
OL,7,Fplace for North West, from Tuesday 11
OL,8,FAugust at 9am until Friday 14 August
OL,9,Fat 9pm.
OL,11,FThe Met Office said it was expecting
OL,12,Ftemperatures to climb to the mid 30Cs
OL,13,Flater in the week.
OL,15,FThe UK is bouncing from one type of
OL,16,Fextreme weather to another after a wet
OL,17,Fwinter became an exceptionally dry
OL,18,Fsummer - leaving the extremes are very
OL,19,Fdifficult for farmers to manage.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G3/7
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
