FL,364,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36304
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F363A1786470511
OL,3,C'We need rain to keep the food
OL,4,Cgrowing': Farmer's stark warning
OL,6,FDavid says the last time he saw any
OL,7,Fuseful rain was at the beginning of
OL,8,FJune and, although a sprinkle of rain
OL,9,Fin July was well received, it was far
OL,10,Ffrom enough.
OL,12,FOn Groobarbs Wild Farm they are asking
OL,13,Ffor help from the Environment Agency
OL,14,Fto use the water already on their farm.
OL,16,FDavid put in a pre-application a year
OL,17,Fago to irrigate the farm using the
OL,18,Flake on the premises. He feels
OL,19,Ffrustrated that he is still waiting to
OL,20,Fhear back.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G4/7
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
