OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,364,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36305
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F363A1786470511
OL,3,C'We need rain to keep the food
OL,4,Cgrowing': Farmer's stark warning
OL,6,F"I want to be able to use that water,"
OL,7,Fhe said. "The lake hasn't dropped at
OL,8,Fall because it's got a nice stream
OL,9,Fflowing into it and we just want to
OL,10,Firrigate about 25 acres.
OL,12,F"I made my full application a month
OL,13,Fago and I thought surely the
OL,14,FEnvironment Agency will help farmers
OL,15,Fwith this cost of living crisis
OL,16,Fbecause we do not want food to go up
OL,17,Fwe want to keep it as cheap as
OL,18,Fpossible."
OL,20,FThe Environment Agency have been
OL,21,Fcontacted for comment.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G5/7
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
