PN,36306
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F363A1786470511
OL,3,C'We need rain to keep the food
OL,4,Cgrowing': Farmer's stark warning
OL,6,FAs pressure mounts on the UK's
OL,7,Fagricultural sector, farmers are
OL,8,Fwarning that the nation's food
OL,9,Fsecurity depends heavily on their
OL,10,Fability to withstand increasingly
OL,11,Funpredictable weather
OL,13,FA spokesperson for Prime Minister Andy
OL,14,FBurnham said: "We know these
OL,15,Fconditions are having a significant
OL,16,Fimpact on communities, farmers and
OL,17,Fbusinesses across the country.
OL,26,@vD@OOU
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G6/7
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
