OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,364,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36307
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F363A1786470511
OL,3,C'We need rain to keep the food
OL,4,Cgrowing': Farmer's stark warning
OL,6,F"Our climate is changing. Droughts are
OL,7,Fbecoming more common, which is why
OL,8,Fwe're focused on both the immediate
OL,9,Fresponse and long-term resilience.
OL,11,F"That includes working through the
OL,12,Fnational drought group with the
OL,13,FEnvironment Agency, water companies,
OL,14,Ffarmers, and environmental
OL,15,Forganisations to protect water
OL,16,Fsupplies and minimise environmental
OL,17,Fdamage."
OL,26,@nD@AOUsD@AOU
